    <h3>Monthly Kirtan Notice</h3>
    <p>The Smaran Tithi Kirtan of Thakur Biswanath Dev will be held on Sunday, 13th September 2026, commencing at 4:00 p.m. (UK time) / 8:30 p.m. (India time). Following the Kirtan, a pre-Kali Puja meeting will also be held on the same day. The venue for both programmes will be Upminster, UK.</p>
    <p>We warmly look forward to your presence and participation on this sacred occasion.</p>
